GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 262(b)(2) the item is described in a., b. or c.` i MEANS
        `s 262(b)(2)a. the item is stock of the surviving, resulting, converted or resulting entity, or depository receipts for it` i
    OR `s 262(b)(2)b. the item is stock of any other corporation, or depository receipts for it, that is listed or widely held at the effective date` i
    OR `s 262(b)(2)c. the item is cash in lieu of fractional shares or fractional depository receipts of the kind in a. or b.` i

-- Subparagraph d.: "Any combination of" what a., b. and c. describe. A single permitted item is covered by a., b. or c.
-- itself, so the combination is a non-empty list of items each of which a., b. or c. describes.
-- src:1259 | d. Any combination of the shares of stock, depository receipts and cash in lieu of fractional shares or fractional depository receipts described in the foregoing paragraphs (b)(2)a., b. and c. of this section.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 262(b)(2)d. (src:1259)
GIVEN items IS A LIST OF `s 262(b)(2) Item of consideration`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 262(b)(2)d. the items are a combination of what a., b. and c. describe` items MEANS
        (NOT null items)
    AND all `s 262(b)(2) the item is described in a., b. or c.` items

